  "goodToKnow": "Der Schadensersatz (also Schadenersatz) is damages or compensation: Schadensersatz fordern, verlangen, leisten. German courts award compensation for actual losses, but no punitive damages like in the US. Compensation for pain and suffering is das Schmerzensgeld. In the diesel scandal, the Federal Court ruled in 2020 that VW owed buyers Schadensersatz. Der Ersatz means replacement. It has no plural."
